patch is merged, anyway 'Test-with' doesn't work for Xe. And, after kernel
patch is merged, rather than just this change, the IGT uapi header should
be sync'd with the kernel uapi header using

	make INSTALL_HDR_PATH=<dest-dir> headers_install

